@tempo 74
@swing 0.65
@fx vinyl 0.3
@fx reverb 0.4
@fx lowpass 0.8
@instrument lead pluck 0.9
@instrument bass cello 0.2
@instrument chord guitar 0.7
@sample kick "Kick Duty Vinyl"
@sample snare "Snare Classic Record"
@sample hat "HiHat Dusty"
@sample perc "Foley Click"

kick:  x . . . . . . . . . x . . . x .
       x . . . . x . . x . . . . x . .

snare: . . . . x . . . . . . . x . . .
       . . . . x . . . . . . x . . . .

hat:   x . x . x . x . x . x . x . x .
       x . x . x . x . x . x . x . x .

perc:  . . x . . . . x . . x . . . x .
       . . . x . . . . . x . . x . . .

bass:  C2 . D2 . C2 . F2 . G2 . A2 . G2 .
       C2 . . . D2 . . . F2 . G2 . C2 . .

lead:  . . C4 . . . . . . . . . A4 . . .
       . . . . . . D4 . . . . . . F4 . .

chords: Csus2 Dsus2  Fsus2 Gsus2
